{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes the game's prologue, an introduction to some of the characters, and the otherworld where the main events of the game occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a legend that if you make a wish on a moonlit night near the lake, it can come true. The main heroine, who didn't want to go home, made the wish and found herself in another world filled with creepy yet very charming monsters. Will she be able to fall in love with any of them, or will she return home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Genres: Visual Novel, Otome, Romance, Horror, Fantasy, Isekai, Yandere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Demo walkthrough: 20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A lot of CG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love interests:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661010/extras/1_eng.jpg?t=1755430758\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661010/extras/2_eng.jpg?t=1755430758\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661010/extras/3_eng.jpg?t=1755430758\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other characters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661010/extras/5_eng.jpg?t=1755430758\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661010/extras/4_eng.jpg?t